WEBVTT

00:03:59.219 --> 00:04:01.300
Sometimes their answers
aren't minor at all.

00:04:01.324 --> 00:04:04.832
Sometimes they talk
about racism and sexism and bullying

00:04:04.856 --> 00:04:09.177
and environmental destruction --
big, global problems we all face.

00:04:09.839 --> 00:04:11.053
But sometimes,

00:04:11.077 --> 00:04:14.347
their answers are very specific,
maybe even oddly specific.

00:04:14.815 --> 00:04:16.950
"That wet line you get across your shirt

00:04:16.974 --> 00:04:20.322
when you accidentally lean
against the counter of a public bathroom."

00:04:20.346 --> 00:04:21.870
(Laughter)

00:04:21.894 --> 00:04:23.505
Super gross, right?

00:04:23.529 --> 00:04:25.037
(Laughter)

00:04:25.061 --> 00:04:28.488
Or "Flash drives: there's only
two ways to plug them in,

00:04:28.512 --> 00:04:30.702
so why does it always
take me three tries?"